The full text of the selected paper license is installed by the
post-generation hook from the vendored texts in `licenses/`.

- CC-BY-4.0: `licenses/CC-BY-4.0.txt`
- MIT: `licenses/MIT.txt`

When the paper is CC-BY-4.0, the code license (MIT) is installed as
`LICENSE-CODE`. When the paper is MIT, `LICENSE` is the single MIT license.
